{1230}{Poisoned, can't go on. 
{1240}{I am penning what is surely to be my last letter.  What fools we have been.
{57020}{The eagle's eye perched in the tree. At the foot of the skull, 41 paces across the river. 15 paces toward Petra's twins. Set down the blue star. Pass through the gate.}
{57110}{When I convinced the high priest that I could help him find the source drawing evil spirits into the catacombs, he allowed me to enter. But he gave me only one Sacred Stone. It allowed me to enter this place, but without another of those stones I can never leave...}
{62020}{Dear Antoine,
{62030}{Captain,
{62040}{Antoine,
{62050}{THE SECRET OF PROFESSOR QUENTIN BLAFARD
{71000}{The Developers Grave
{71010}{The Grayhills Module
{71020}{Safe combination:
{76000}{My dearest love,
